{"_comment":"Single source for the banned-words list. Consumed by both the model (during drafting/editing, to avoid these words and apply the condition/note judgment) and scripts/mechanical_sweep.py (to flag occurrences). The judgment prose (plain-diction principle, jargon-gloss, business cliches, legal-register metaphors, replacement-overuse guard) lives in references/ai-patterns.md; only this enumerated list lives here.","match_note":"term is the bare token for matching (word-boundary, case-insensitive). Apply 'condition' before flagging (some bans are context-specific). replace_with=null means rewrite the sentence; no direct substitute.","class_note":"Optional per-entry 'class' (A = direct substitute, B = recast or cut) overrides the derived class. Derived: replace_with null, or a replacement that is a parenthetical instruction, gives B; any real substitute gives A. Set it explicitly only where that derivation is ambiguous.","replacement_overuse_guard":"Replacements are not free passes. 'Key' may appear at most twice per article as an adjective; do not route every banned intensifier to the same substitute. Where a sentence survives without any intensifier, cut it entirely; most do.","adjective_key_max_per_article":2,"words":[{"term":"seldom","replace_with":"rarely"},{"term":"jurisdictions","replace_with":"countries, states, regions","condition":"when meaning 'countries/states'","note":"use the concrete unit"},{"term":"regimes","replace_with":"regulations, rules","condition":"when meaning 'regulations'"},{"term":"scrutiny","replace_with":"review, inspection"},{"term":"purpose-built","replace_with":"built"},{"term":"consolidating","replace_with":"combining"},{"term":"capture","replace_with":"record, log, collect","condition":"as a verb, when meaning 'record' or 'collect'","note":"context-dependent; keep 'capture' only in its literal/technical sense (capturing an image, a system capturing data automatically), swap it where it stands in for a plainer verb"},{"term":"utilize","replace_with":"use"},{"term":"leverage","replace_with":"use, apply, take advantage of","condition":"as a verb"},{"term":"multifaceted","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"paramount","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"in today's world","replace_with":"\"Right now,\" \"In [year],\" \"Across regulated industries\"","condition":"also 'in today's fast-paced'"},{"term":"it's important to note","replace_with":"\"Worth keeping in mind,\" \"Keep in mind\""},{"term":"remember","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite as a direct instruction"},{"term":"crucial","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite; vary: central, decisive, required, or restructure"},{"term":"ensure","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite - usually cuts cleanly"},{"term":"essential","replace_with":"required, necessary, mandatory"},{"term":"pivotal","replace_with":"central, decisive"},{"term":"furthermore","replace_with":null,"note":"start a new sentence or use 'Beyond that,'"},{"term":"moreover","replace_with":null,"note":"start a new sentence"},{"term":"navigating","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"landscape","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"realm","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"foster","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"facilitate","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"delve","replace_with":"look at, dig into, explore"},{"term":"cutting-edge","replace_with":"modern, current, advanced"},{"term":"game-changer","replace_with":"significant shift, major improvement"},{"term":"unlock","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"comprehensive","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite - usually just cuts"},{"term":"robust","replace_with":"strong, solid, reliable"},{"term":"streamline","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"holistic","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"notably","replace_with":null,"note":"start the next point directly"},{"term":"consequently","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite with a natural bridge"},{"term":"additionally","replace_with":null,"note":"start the next point directly"},{"term":"revolutionize","replace_with":"change, transform, reshape"},{"term":"seamlessly","replace_with":null,"note":"remove or rewrite the sentence"},{"term":"harness the power of","replace_with":"use, apply, put [X] to work"},{"term":"in conclusion","replace_with":null,"note":"just write the closing; or 'To sum up,'"},{"term":"testament","replace_with":null,"condition":"figurative","note":"rewrite as the concrete fact"},{"term":"underscore","replace_with":"(state the point directly)","condition":"as a verb; incl. 'underscores'","class":"B"},{"term":"highlight","replace_with":"show, point to, or restructure","condition":"figurative verb","class":"A"},{"term":"showcase","replace_with":"show, demonstrate","condition":"incl. 'showcasing'"},{"term":"emphasize","replace_with":"(state the point; or 'stress' when a source literally stresses something)","condition":"figurative; incl. 'emphasizing'","class":"B"},{"term":"boasts","replace_with":"has","condition":"meaning 'has'"},{"term":"vital","replace_with":"required, necessary"},{"term":"interplay","replace_with":"relationship, interaction"},{"term":"intricate","replace_with":"detailed, complex","condition":"incl. 'intricacies' -> details"},{"term":"meticulous","replace_with":"careful, exact","condition":"incl. 'meticulously' -> carefully"},{"term":"garner","replace_with":"gain, earn, attract"},{"term":"bolster","replace_with":"strengthen, support","condition":"incl. 'bolstered'"},{"term":"tapestry","replace_with":null,"condition":"figurative","note":"rewrite"},{"term":"align with","replace_with":"match, meet, follow, comply with","condition":"incl. 'aligns with'"},{"term":"enduring","replace_with":"lasting, long-standing"},{"term":"evolving","replace_with":"changing","condition":"as a filler modifier","note":"or cut"},{"term":"stands as","replace_with":"is","condition":"incl. 'serves as'"},{"term":"plays a key/vital/pivotal/crucial role","replace_with":null,"note":"state what it actually does"},{"term":"vibrant","replace_with":null,"note":"rewrite"},{"term":"enhance","replace_with":"improve, raise","note":"or rewrite"},{"term":"valuable insights","replace_with":null,"note":"name the specific finding"}]}
